---
// Markup + mount points only; all behavior lives in src/scripts/the-dashboard-problem/study-chart.ts.
---

<section id="metric-study" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 md:px-12 md:py-20">
	<h2 class="font-anton text-4xl md:text-5xl">What happens as you test more metrics</h2>
	<p class="mt-3 max-w-[65ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
		Simulate hundreds of independent dashboards at each of several metric counts (2, 5, 10, 20, 30, 50), and measure
		how often each rule gets fooled by at least one false discovery, and how many of the genuinely real effects it
		still manages to find.
	</p>

	<form id="pp-study-controls" class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 raw-box rounded-xl bg-cream p-6 md:grid-cols-4">
		<label class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-sm">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-soft">Fraction genuinely lifted</span>
			<input id="pp-study-fraction-lifted" type="range" min="0" max="0.6" step="0.05" class="accent-accent-blue w-full" />
			<span id="pp-study-fraction-lifted-value" class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft"></span>
		</label>
		<label class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-sm">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-soft">Baseline rate (%)</span>
			<input id="pp-study-baseline-rate" type="number" min="1" max="50" step="1" class="border-2 border-black bg-paper px-3 py-2 text-ink" />
		</label>
		<label class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-sm">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-soft">Lift on real effects (%)</span>
			<input id="pp-study-relative-lift" type="number" min="5" max="100" step="5" class="border-2 border-black bg-paper px-3 py-2 text-ink" />
		</label>
		<div class="flex items-end">
			<button
				type="button"
				id="pp-study-run-button"
				class="w-full border border-ink bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-paper transition-colors hover:border-accent-blue hover:bg-accent-blue"
			>
				Run metric-count study
			</button>
		</div>
	</form>
	<p class="mt-2 max-w-[65ch] text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
		Each run simulates 300 independent dashboards at each of six metric counts, 1,800 simulated experiments total.
	</p>

	<div id="pp-metric-study" class="mt-6">
		<div data-vg-summary class="raw-box rounded-xl bg-cream p-4 font-mono text-sm"></div>
		<div class="mt-4 flex justify-end">
			<button type="button" data-vg-table-toggle class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-blue" aria-pressed="false">
				View as table
			</button>
		</div>
		<div data-vg-chart class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 overflow-x-auto md:grid-cols-2"></div>
		<div data-vg-table class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto"></div>
	</div>

	<script src="../../../scripts/the-dashboard-problem/study-chart.ts"></script>
</section>
